You now have a simple, responsive Instagram-style login page with dark theme support built in Flutter. Feel free to adjust the styling, spacing, and logic to match your desired functionality.

Below is an example implementation. In this example the component uses a Shadow DOM and defines three slots (“header”, “intro” and “details”). The header area displays an indicator square containing a plus (“+”) when collapsed and a minus (“–”) when expanded, followed by the slotted header content. While collapsed, the intro part is visible along with a button labeled “expand more”; when expanded the details part becomes visible and the button label changes.

